### Lab 01: Core HTTP Server REST Client Requests
### Tested with VS Code REST Client extension

### 1. Root Welcome Endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/
Accept: text/plain

### 2. Current Date and Time Endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/date
Accept: application/json

### 3. Dynamic HTML Page Endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/page
Accept: text/html

### 4. System and Course Information API
GET http://localhost:3000/api/info
Accept: application/json
